  'Every action, who did it and when. This log is append-only.': 'Ifyo bacita, uwaficitile no lilali. Ibuku ili lilembwa fye, talifumishiwa.|Zochita zonse, amene anazichita ndi liti. Mbiri iyi imangowonjezeredwa.|Zyoonse zyakacitwa, nguni alimwi lili. Rekodi eeyi iyungwa buyo.|Ketso kaufela, ya li ketileng ni lili. Buka ye i ekezwa feela.|Byonse byakanwa, ani ne lilumbi. Rekodi eyi yongelwa fyo.|Vyejima vyazata, njiyi nikwakumbi. Rekodi yeniyi yongeka hohu.|Vyosena vyazata, ngweji nalyehi. Rekodi kanou yongelwa hohu.',
  'Members flag entries from their phone (USSD option 4). Resolution notes are kept as history.': 'Abanyina bapusha ifyalembwa pa feni (USSD 4). Ifyo bapwishisha filasungwa.|Mamembala amafunsa zolembedwa pa foni (USSD 4). Zigamulo zimasungidwa.|Bamembala balabuzya cakulembwa kufoni (USSD 4). Zisinizyo zilabambilwa.|Bamemba ba botisa ka foni (USSD 4). Likalafo li bolokwa.|Bamembala bapula bilembwa pa foni (USSD 4). Bipwisho bisungwa.|Amembala adiwula chakulembeka hafoni (USSD 4). Yakukumisha yasungawu.|Vamembala vapwa vyasonekwa hafoni (USSD 4). Mpwisho yasekwa.',
  'Entries are permanent and cannot be deleted. To fix a mistake, use Reverse, which adds a correcting entry and keeps the history.': 'Ifyalembwa tafumishiwa. Ukulungika ubwafya, shimikeni Bwesha, ilembapo icalembwa cipya.|Zolembedwa sizichotsedwa. Kukonza cholakwika, gwiritsani Bwezani, yomwe imawonjezera cholembedwa chatsopano.|Zakulembwa tazisulwi. Kugwasya, amubelesye Bweze, ikubikka cakulembwa cipya.|Se si ñolilwe ha si tuhelwi. Ku lukisa liphoso, mu sebelise Busa, i eketsa se si nca.|Bilembwa kechi bifumishiwa. Kuwamisha, sebenzesha Bwezha, kyongela kilembwa kya pya.|Vyakulembeka kavifumishawu. Kulondolola, zatishenu Zeyesha, yilembaku chipya.|Vyasonekwa kavifumisiwa. Kuwahisa, tumisa Fwetesa, yinongela chasonekwa chipya.',
  'Record who attended. Absence fines post automatically and members get an SMS.': 'Landeni abaleshibwa. Ifine lya kubula lilemba fye, abanyina balatambula SMS.|Lembani amene analipo. Zindapusa zosapezeka zimalowa zokha, mamembala amalandira SMS.|Amulembe aabo bakaliko. Milango yakutaboneka ilalembwa alike, bamembala balatambula SMS.|Mu ñole ba ba bile teng. Lisupo za ku ba sa teng li ñolwa ka bolona, bamemba ba fumana SMS.|Lemba bakiliko. Ifine ya kubula yalembwa yeni, bamembala bapokelela SMS.|Lembenu atwesi. Ifine yakuhana yilembekaña yeni, amembala apokolela SMS.|Soneka vaze valiko. Ifine yakuhana yisonekwa yene, vamembala vapokola SMS.',
  'Members choose their own language when they first dial, and can change it any time from the USSD menu (option 6). Officers can also set it here. SMS receipts use the same language.': 'Abanyina basala ululimi lwabo pa kutendeka, kabili balashintilila pa USSD (6). Abaleshi nabo balashintilila apa. SMS ikoma mu lulimi lumo.|Mamembala amasankha chilankhulo akayamba kuimba, ndipo amatha kusintha pa USSD (6). Atsogoleri amatha kusintha apa. SMS imakhala chimodzimodzi.|Bamembala balisala ciyaluulo cabo, alimwi balakucincinya pa USSD (6). Basilutwe balakucincinya aano. SMS ilaboola muciyaluulo comwe.|Bamemba ba itiba puo ya bona, mi ba ka fetola ka USSD (6). Batahisi ba ka i fetola mona. SMS i ba ka puo e swana.|Bamembala basala mwa kwamba, kabiji bashinja pa USSD (6). Bakulumpe bashinja pano. SMS yaya mu mwa kwamba umo.|Amembala asakula mwakulumbulwila, kaha ashinjika hakukumbuka USSD (6). Atuleñi ashinjika pano. SMS yikwisa mwakulumbulwila mumu.|Vamembala vasakula lilimi, kaha vashinjika pa USSD (6). Vatwamina vashinjika apa. SMS yikwiza lilimi limwe.',
