  'Every posting sends the member a confirmation. Failed messages can be retried.': 'Ifyalembwa fyonse fitumina umwina SMS. Ifilepwa fingeshiwa kabili.|Cholembedwa chilichonse chimatumiza uthenga kwa membala. Zolephera zimatha kuyesedwa kachiwiri.|Cakulembwa coonse cilatuma SMS kumumembala. Zilemene zilakonzya kweelwa alubo.|Se si ñolilwe se si ñwi ni se si ñwi si romela SMS. Tse di hanyehile di ka leka hape.|Kilembwa kyonse kitumina SMS. Byalema bishashiwa kabiji.|Chakulembeka chejima chitumina SMS. Chalema chakeshawu kapwa.|Chasonekwa chosena chituma SMS. Chalemena chesekwa lyehi.',
  'Only the chairperson and treasurer can match payments.': 'Kapalume na kasunga ndalama fye nibo bapamfya ukulipila.|Wapampando ndi msungichuma okha ndi omwe amagwirizanitsa malipiro.|Sibwanga alimwi amwaalu wamali buyo balakonzya kugwasyilizya kubbadela.|Mutahisi ni mubolokisi feela ba ka tokanisa litefo.|Mukulumpe ne musungi wa mali fyo bambukanya kulipila.|Mwanta nimusungi wambongo hohu atachikisha kuzeya.|Mutwamina namusungi wambongo hohu vahanyanya kufweta.',
  'Paste a confirmation SMS, then choose the member it belongs to. Nothing is posted until you confirm.': 'Bikeni SMS ya kushininkisha, mupinde musale umwina. Ifyalembwa tafilembwa mukanashininkisha.|Ikani SMS yotsimikizira, kenako sankhani membala. Palibe chimalembedwa mpaka mutsimikize.|Amubikke SMS yakusinizya, mukasale mumembala. Tazilembwi kusikila musinizye.|Mu apese SMS ya ku tiyisa, mi mu bate memba. Ha ku ñolwa se si ñwi ku fitela mu tiyisa.|Bika SMS ya kusuminisha, mukasale membala. Kechi kilembwa kufika musuminishe.|Bikenu SMS yakutondolola, musakule membala. Kakulembekawu mpinji mutondolola.|Bika SMS yakusimbwila, usakule membala. Kuhana kusoneka hanga usimbwile.',
