  'Codes match the verification code in the SMS the member received for each entry.': 'Ama code yalingana ne code mu SMS iyo umwina apokelele pa cintu conse.|Ma khodi amafanana ndi khodi mu SMS imene membala analandira pa cholembedwa chilichonse.|Ma code alafwaanana acode mu SMS iyo mumembala njakatambula acakulembwa coonse.|Li-khodi li tokana ni khodi ya SMS ye memba a e fumaneng ka se se ñwi ni se se ñwi.|Ma code yanyana ne code mu SMS yapokelwa na membala pa kilembwa kyonse.|Ma code ayanana nacode muSMS yapokola membala pachakulembeka chejima.|Ma code yakwata kuwana nacode muSMS yapokola vamembala pachasonekwa chosena.',
